{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/27acccd19a3439de0d29f1d459d74b1f.avif?t=1768496423\" width=1280 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/01bab675c1d0edf8a8ebc1d9d632d9fd.poster.avif?t=1768496423\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/01bab675c1d0edf8a8ebc1d9d632d9fd.webm?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/01bab675c1d0edf8a8ebc1d9d632d9fd.mp4?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn, find and upgrade dozens of spells to use in battle against enemies! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how spells work to fit your playstyle in real-time with customizable quick-access loadouts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover more powerful hidden spells scattered throughout the mystical realms of Hexrite.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/562d6e947efa24042f6e71926663a7b4.avif?t=1768496423\" width=1280 height=280 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/26d464df58ef056e3ac18bc4eb6ac8f2.poster.avif?t=1768496423\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/26d464df58ef056e3ac18bc4eb6ac8f2.webm?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/26d464df58ef056e3ac18bc4eb6ac8f2.mp4?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invoke powerful magical areas that surround you and enemies, giving you powerful new abilities and changing the current battle in your favour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Domes not only make you more powerful, but also affect the environment and battlefield!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/d01364764ad5652a1f996a959b276d18.avif?t=1768496423\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/650c70f889c06853189f10b1c4797abd.poster.avif?t=1768496423\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/650c70f889c06853189f10b1c4797abd.webm?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621770/extras/650c70f889c06853189f10b1c4797abd.mp4?t=1768496423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seas in the sky to fiery paper peaks, mystery and sorcery extends far in the worlds you can travel to in Hexrite. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform your way through colorful stylized levels using a variety of platforming mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All levels have their own platforming puzzles, from jumping on jellyfish to riding a rail made of a dragon\u2019s skin!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=